        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. Mr. Aditya Singh, Advocate, submitted that the applicant no.1 and the informant-respondent no.2 are real brothers.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 786,
      "end": 903,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Aditya Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 793,
          "end": 805
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Applicant no.2 is the daughter of the applicant no.1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 904,
      "end": 957,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18112178146839142
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "According to the First Information Report dated 15.01.2022, the applicant no.1, showing himself as Mohd. Asaf Khan son of late Mohd. Sharif Khan, renewed the licence of his late father's revolver.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 958,
      "end": 1154,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "15.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1006,
          "end": 1016
        },
        {
          "text": "Mohd. Asaf Khan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1057,
          "end": 1072
        },
        {
          "text": "Mohd. Sharif Khan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1085,
          "end": 1102
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1623471975326538
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Applicants threatened to kill the informant and his son.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1155,
      "end": 1211,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20930562913417816
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The said allegations are false.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1212,
      "end": 1243,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13260005414485931
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "4. Mr. Aditya Singh, Advocate, contended that licence of his late father's revolver was transferred in the name of the applicant on 29.01.2022.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1245,
      "end": 1388,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Aditya Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1252,
          "end": 1264
        },
        {
          "text": "29.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1377,
          "end": 1387
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17328396439552307
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Applicant no.1 lodged an FIR (FIR No.19 of 2022) against the informant of the present FIR and others.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1389,
      "end": 1490,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25681281089782715
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The present FIR has been lodged in counterblast to the said FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1491,
      "end": 1555,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1605405956506729
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "5. Mr. Akshay Latwal, Assistant Government Advocate, has sought three weeks' time to file counter affidavit.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
